#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:77
msgid ""
"This feature allows you to trigger an AI-based generation of a [knowledge "
"base](/en/documentation/use/guides/knowledge-base)  answer from a ticket. "
"This is useful if you often get similar tickets and want to quickly create a "
"knowledge base article for such cases. Doing so helps you and your "
"colleagues solve similar tickets more efficiently in the future. It might "
"even reduce incoming ticket volume when customers can resolve their issues "
"directly from the published knowledge base."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:80
msgid ""
"This feature is available in the **Related knowledge** section of the ticket "
"sidebar. Click the **Add AI draft** button to trigger the answer generation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:82
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Things to avoid:"
msgid "Things to consider:"
msgstr "Ствари за избегавање:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:90
msgid ""
"The knowledge base answer is generated as draft and not published "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Чланак базе знања се генерише као нацрт и неће бити аутоматски објављен."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:90
msgid "You are set as the answer's author."
msgstr "Ви ћете бити постављени као аутор чланка."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:90
msgid "The answer is generated in the default language of your knowledge base."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:90
msgid ""
"The answer includes a note in the content and a tag (`ai-generated`) about "
"the AI generation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:90
msgid ""
"A link to the answer is added to the ticket from which you triggered the "
"answer generation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:90
msgid ""
"The answer is created in a knowledge base category for which you have editor "
"permissions. The AI chooses one of these categories."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:93
msgid ""
"If a similar knowledge base answer already exists, Zammad shows it in a "
"dialog before creating a new one. This gives you the chance to review "
"existing related answers to prevent duplicate submissions."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:94
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Knowledge base general"
msgid "Knowledge base answer suggestion"
msgstr "Опште о бази знања"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:101
msgid ""
"This feature compares the ticket content against the knowledge base and "
"shows relevant answers under **Suggested by AI** if they meet the admin-"
"configured score threshold. Each suggestion shows the title of the answer "
"and more details on hover. An additional relevance score is only shown to "
"users with the corresponding admin permissions. Click on the title to open "
"the answer in the knowledge base. Click the ::+:: on the right side which "
"appears when hovering with the mouse to link it to the ticket."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:103
msgid ""
"If no suggestions are available, the message \"No suggestions.\" is "
"displayed instead."
msgstr ""
"Уколико нема релевантних предлога, биће приказана порука „Без предлога”."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "AI agents"
msgstr "AI агенти"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:110
msgid ""
"AI agents can be configured to work on certain types of routine tasks. In "
"general, this feature operates behind the scenes but if configured, you may "
"notice it in some situations (see examples below). In case your admin "
"created a macro with an AI agent action, you can even run it manually. Ask "
"your admin for details and have a look at the [macro description](/en/"
"documentation/use/advanced-features#macros) in the advanced features page."
msgstr ""
"Оператери вештачке интелигенције могу бити подешени за рад на одређеним "
"врстама рутинских задатака. Генерално, ова функција ради у позадини, али ако "
"је конфигурисана, можете је приметити у неким ситуацијама (види примера "
"испод). Ако је ваш администратор креирао макро са акцијом оператера вештачке "
"интелигенције, можете га чак покренути и ручно. Затражите детаље од "
"администратора и погледајте [опис макроа](/en/documentation/use/advanced-"
"features#macros) на страници за напредне функције."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:111
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/mobile-view.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ticket history"
msgstr "Историјат тикета"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:115
msgid ""
"If an AI agent applied changes, you can see a ticket history entry telling "
"you the name of the AI agent. If you notice ongoing issues with what the AI "
"agent did, inform your Zammad admin. Example of a history entry of an AI "
"agent:"
msgstr ""
"Уколико AI агент освежи тикет, можете то и видети у евиденцији историјата "
"тикета под називом AI агента. Уколико приметите проблеме са начином рада AI "
"агента, обавестите о томе свог Zammad администратора."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:117
msgid ""
"![Screenshot shows AI agent ticket history entry](/screenshots/documentation/"
"use/ai/ai-agent-ticket-history.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Пример снимка екрана (пуна страна)](/screenshots/documentation/use/ai/ai-"
"agent-ticket-history.png)"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:118
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simultaneous work detection"
msgstr "Откривање истовремене обраде"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:123
msgid ""
"AI agents which are currently working on a ticket are displayed like other "
"agents in the live user section in the bottom bar. This helps to avoid "
"duplicate work as well as losing unsaved changes. If you see an AI agent "
"avatar, wait for a moment or head over to another ticket."
msgstr ""
"AI агенти који тренутно раде на тикету су приказани као и други оператери у "
"доњој траци присутних корисника. Ово ће вам помоћи да избегнете истовремени "
"рад као и губитак несачуваних измена. Уколико приметите сличицу AI агента, "
"сачекајте тренутак или пређите на други тикет."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:125
msgid "Avatar of AI agent:"
msgstr "Сличица AI агента:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:127
msgid ""
"![Screenshot shows avatar of an AI agent](/screenshots/documentation/use/ai/"
"ai-live-user.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Пример снимка екрана (пуна страна)](/screenshots/documentation/use/ai/ai-"
"live-user.png)"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview indicator"
msgstr "Индикатор прегледа"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:131
msgid ""
"A running AI agent is indicated in the status column in overviews. The "
"status circle changes to a blue/pink gradient circle:"
msgstr ""
"AI агент који се извршава има индикатор у колони стања у прегледима. Кружић "
"стања ће бити приказан у плаво-љубичастом градијенту:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/ai.md:132
