#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/knowledge-base.md:26
msgid ""
"The knowledge base is organized into **categories** that can contain "
"subcategories and **answers** (articles).  Each category requires an icon "
"and a title. Answers consist of a title and rich text content with "
"formatting, images, videos, file attachments, and links."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/knowledge-base.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "Видљивост"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/knowledge-base.md:30
msgid "Each answer has a visibility level that controls who can see it:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/knowledge-base.md:36
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "|                                             | GUI configuration | Environment variable       |\n"
#| "|---------------------------------------------|-------------------|----------------------------|\n"
#| "| Host OS access required                     | No                | Yes                        |\n"
#| "| Automatically excluded loopback addresses   | Yes               | No                         |\n"
#| "| Configuration check                         | Yes               | Manually via test script   |\n"
#| "| Exceptions                                  | Yes               | No                         |\n"
msgid ""
"| Color | Level                       | Who can see it                                                     |\n"
"|-------|---------------------------  |--------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| Green | **Public**                  | Everyone, including customers browsing the public knowledge base   |\n"
"| Blue  | **Internal**                | Agents and editors only                                            |\n"
"| Gray  | **Draft** or **Archived**   | Editors only                                                       |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Тип                  | Истицање у документацији      | Markdown синтакса               |\n"
"|----------------------|-------------------------------|---------------------------------|\n"
"| Означени дугмићи     | `Пријава`                     | \\`Пријава\\`                     |\n"
"| Поља и елементи      | **Назив**                     | \\*\\*Назив\\*\\*                   |\n"
"| Путања/локације      | _Подешавања > Канали > Имејл_ | \\_Подешавања > Канали > Имејл\\_ |\n"
"| Пречице на тастатури | [[x]]                         | \\[\\[x\\]\\]                       |\n"
"| Дугме за додавање    | ::+::                         | \\:\\:\\+\\:\\:                      |\n"
"| Дугме за брисање     | ::x::                         | \\:\\:\\x\\:\\:                      |\n"
"| Дугме за мени радњи  | ::a::                         | \\:\\:\\a\\:\\:                      |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/knowledge-base.md:38
