msgstr "Ако нисте сигурни да ли је Zammad прави алат за вас, тестирајте га користећи бесплатну пробну инстанцу."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: features link
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://zammad.com/en/getting-started"
msgstr "https://zammad.com/en/company"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: features title
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Free trial"
msgstr "Бесплатна пробна верзија"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: features details
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get your cloud-based Zammad here. No installation, no hassle, we take care of everything!"
msgstr "Набавите ваш цлоуд заснован Zammad овде. Без инсталације, без муке, ми бринемо о свему!"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: features title
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Zammad hosted services"
msgstr "Користите Zammad-ов хостинг сервис"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: features details
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can even self-host Zammad. Find installation instructions here."
msgstr "Чак можете и сами хостовати Zammad. Пронађите упутства за инсталацију овде."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: features link
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "/en/get-started/installation/prerequisites"
msgstr "/en/get-started/installation/prerequisites"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: features title
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Self hosting"
msgstr "Инсталација у сопственој режији"

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get Zammad"
msgstr "Преузмите Zammad"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:24
msgid ""
"Not using Zammad yet? You will like it! Choose your favorite option below or "
"read on in the sections below."
msgstr ""
"Још увек не користите Zammad? Свидеће вам се! Погледајте одељке испод за "
"различите опције."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:30
msgid ""
"If you have questions, feel free to [get in touch with us](https://"
"zammad.com/en/company/contact){target=_blank} and to have a look at the "
"[community forum](https://community.zammad.org/){target=_blank} were you can "
"find useful information and help."
msgstr ""
"Уколико имате додатних питања, слободно [нам се обратите](https://zammad.com/"
"en/company/contact){target=_blank} или погледајте [форум](https://"
"community.zammad.org/){target=_blank} где можете пронаћи корисне информације "
"и помоћ."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Testing Zammad"
msgstr "Проба Zammad-а"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:39
msgid ""
"We are sure you like Zammad! The easiest way to test it is to use a [free "
"trial instance](https://zammad.com/en/getting-started){target=_blank}.  You "
"can play around and then you can switch to an official supported instance, "
"either keeping your data or start with an empty system."
msgstr ""
"Сигурни смо да ће вам се Zammad свидети! Најлакши начин да га пробате је да "
"искористите [бесплатну пробну инстанцу](https://zammad.com/en/getting-"
"started){target=_blank}. Можете се поиграти и на крају пређи на званичну "
"подршку, са чувањем ваших података или почети испочетка."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Zammad's hosted service"
msgstr "Користите Zammad-ов хостинг сервис"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:45
msgid ""
"To use Zammad in production, head over to our sister site [zammad.com]"
"(https://zammad.com/en/pricing){target=_blank} where you can find prices for "
"Zammad's hosted services."
msgstr ""
"Да бисте користили Zammad у продукцији, идите на наш званичан сајт "
"[zammad.com](https://zammad.com/en/pricing){target=_blank} где можете "
"пронаћи ценовних нашег хостинг сервиса."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Self hosted installation"
msgstr "Инсталација у сопственој режији"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:51
msgid ""
"You can even host Zammad on your own. Read our [installation instructions](/"
"en/get-started/installation/prerequisites) and see which deployment method "
"fits your needs."
msgstr ""
"Zammad можете чак и сами да хостујете. Погледајте наше [упутство за "
"инсталацију](/sr/get-started/installation/prerequisites) и који начин "
"покретања вам највише одговара."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/get-zammad.md:54
msgid ""
"If you are a self-hosted user and want to have support at hand, our sales "
"team is happy to get in touch with you. Just leave them [a message](https://"
"zammad.com/en/company/contact){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Уколико сте корисник који сам хостује и желите пуну техничку подршку, наш "
"продајни тим ће радо ступити у контакт са вама. Оставите им [поруку](https://"
"zammad.com/en/company/contact){target=_blank}."

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:1
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Host upgrade and repository migration"
msgstr "Надоградња хоста и миграција repo-зиторијума"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:9
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:9
#: src/en/get-started/installation/prerequisites.md:9
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:9
#: src/en/tutorials/connect-config-elasticsearch.md:9
#: src/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch.md:9
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "<!--@include: @/en/modules/zammad-services-hint.md-->\n"
msgstr "<!--@include: @/sr/modules/zammad-services-hint.md-->\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:13
msgid ""
"This page covers the required steps for a host upgrade and to switch to "
"Zammad's new package repositories. If you just want to update Zammad itself, "
"please refer to [Updating Zammad](update). To just switch to the new "
"repositories without a host upgrade, skip the host upgrade steps."
msgstr ""
"Ова страница покрива потребне кораке за надоградњу хоста и прелазак на нове "
"пакетне repo-зиторијуме Zammad-а. Ако желите само да ажурирате Zammad, "
"погледајте [Ажурирање Zammad-а](update). Да бисте се пребацили само на нове "
"repo-зиторијуме без надоградње хоста, прескочите кораке за надоградњу хоста."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:18
msgid ""
"Starting with Zammad 7, packages are being built using a new toolchain and "
"hosted under another URL. The packages are being built via old toolchain as "
"well (except for Debian 13) for some time, but we encourage you to switch to "
"the new repositories in a timely manner. This means you need to add a new "
"repository key and change your repository configuration."
msgstr ""
"Почев од Zammad-а 7, пакети се граде новом алатном линијом и хостују на "
"другој URL адреси. Пакети ће се градити и старом алатном линијом (осим за "
"Debian 13) још неко време, али вас подстичемо да правовремено пређете на "
"нове repo-зиторијуме. То значи да морате додати нови кључ repo-зиторијума и "
"променити конфигурацију."

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Always make sure to have a [backup](/en/tutorials/backup-restore) of your data before performing an upgrade.\n"
msgstr "Увек се уверите да имате [резервну копију](/en/tutorials/backup-restore) података пре извршавања надоградње.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:24
msgid "The following operating systems are supported:"
msgstr "Следеће опције проксија приступа су подржане:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:31
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Distribution         | Version              |\n"
"| -------------------- | :------------------- |\n"
"| CentOS/RHEL          | 9, 10                |\n"
"| Debian               | 11, 12 & 13          |\n"
"| OpenSUSE Leap / SLES | 15 & 16              |\n"
"| Ubuntu               | 22.04, 24.04 & 26.04 |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Дистрибуција  | Верзија             |\n"
"| ------------- | :-----------------  |\n"
"| CentOS/RHEL   | 8 и 9               |\n"
"| Debian        | 11 и 12             |\n"
"| OpenSUSE/SLES | Leap 15.x / 15      |\n"
"| Ubuntu        | 20.04, 22.04, 24.04 |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:32
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Stop Zammad"
msgstr "Преузмите Zammad"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:34
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:35 src/en/tutorials/migrate-host.md:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl stop zammad\n"
msgstr "systemctl старт заммад\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Host upgrade steps"
msgstr "Кораци надоградње хоста"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disable updates for Zammad"
msgstr "Коришћење Zammad-а"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper addlock zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf upgrade --exclude zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper addlock zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf upgrade --exclude zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform host upgrade"
msgstr "Извршите надоградњу хоста"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:74
msgid ""
"Perform the host upgrade according to the documentation of your operating "
"system. Because this is an advanced task, we don't provide detailed steps "
"here. After upgrading your operating system, proceed with the next steps."
msgstr ""
"Извршите надоградњу хоста према документацији вашег оперативног система. С "
"обзиром на то што је ово напредан задатак, не пружамо детаљне кораке овде. "
"Након надоградње оперативног система, наставите са следећим корацима."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reboot host"
msgstr "Рестартујте хост"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:80
msgid ""
"In case you did not reboot your system after the upgrade, make sure to "
"reboot your system now. Afterwards, check if everything is running as "
"expected. In case Zammad starts automatically, stop it again before "
"proceeding with the next steps."
msgstr ""
"Ако нисте рестартовали систем након надоградње, сада га обавезно "
"рестартујте. Затим проверите да ли све ради како треба. Ако се Zammad "
"покрене аутоматски, поново га зауставите пре наставка са следећим корацима."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust package repository"
msgstr "Додајте Zammad репозиториј"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove old repository"
msgstr "Додајте Zammad репозиториј"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:86
msgid ""
"Remove the old repository configuration file or disable/delete the old "
"repository in your package manager."
msgstr ""
"Уклоните стари фајл конфигурације repo-зиторијума или онемогућите/обришите "
"стари repo-зиторијум у управљачу пакета."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:87
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"Ubuntu 22.04:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/sources.list.d/zammad.sources\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Ubuntu 24.04:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/sources.list.d/zammad.list\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/sources.list.d/zammad.list\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/zypp/repos.d/zammad.repo\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/yum.repos.d/zammad.repo\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"Ubuntu 22.04:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/sources.list.d/zammad.sources\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Ubuntu 24.04:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/sources.list.d/zammad.list\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/sources.list.d/zammad.list\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/zypp/repos.d/zammad.repo\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/yum.repos.d/zammad.repo\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove old repository key"
msgstr "Додајте Zammad репозиториј"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:127
msgid ""
"Remove the old repository key from your system. Depending on your operating "
"system and version, the location or method differs."
msgstr ""
"Уклоните стари кључ repo-зиторијума са вашег система. Зависно од оперативног "
"система и верзије, локација или метод се разликују."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:128
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/keyrings/pkgr-zammad.gpg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rm /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/pkgr-zammad.gpg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"List the keys of your system:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"rpm -q gpg-pubkey --qf '%{name}-%{version}-%{release} --> %{summary}\\n'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Delete the key(s) related to Zammad (and only those!), replace `<key-name>` with the actual key ID:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rpm -e <key-name>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"List the keys of your system:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"rpm -q gpg-pubkey --qf '%{name}-%{version}-%{release} --> %{summary}\\n'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Delete the key(s) related to Zammad (and only those!), replace `<key-name>` with the actual key ID:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo rpm -e <key-name>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
