msgstr "Инсталација"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/en/get-started/installation/kubernetes.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Kubernetes"
msgstr "Kubernetes"

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/get-started/installation/kubernetes.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Kubernetes installation"
msgstr "Инсталација"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/kubernetes.md:10
msgid ""
"You can find installation instructions in the [documentation of our helm "
"chart](https://github.com/zammad/zammad-helm/blob/main/zammad/README.md)"
"{target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Упутство за инсталацију можете пронаћи у [документацији нашег helm chart-а]"
"(https://github.com/zammad/zammad-helm/blob/main/zammad/README.md)."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/kubernetes.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We do not provide support in terms of Kubernetes specific problems. If you\n"
"choose to run Zammad via Kubernetes, support is only provided for the Zammad\n"
"application.\n"
msgstr ""
"Не пружамо техничку подршку у вези специфичних Kubernetes проблема. Уколико\n"
"одлучите да покренете Zammad преко Kubernetes, подршка је обезбеђена само за Zammad\n"
"апликацију.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package"
msgstr "Пакет"

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package installation"
msgstr "Инсталација пакета"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported operating systems"
msgstr "Подржани оперативни системи"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:13
msgid ""
"For package installation, the following Linux distributions are supported:"
msgstr ""
"За инсталацију пакета, подржане су следеће дистрибуције Linux платформе:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:24
msgid ""
"If your distribution is not supported, feel free to use a different "
"installation method or consider using [Zammad's cloud service](https://"
"zammad.com/en/pricing){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Уколико ваша дистрибуција тренутно није подржана, пробајте други метод "
"инсталације или размотрите претплату на [Zammad сервис у облаку](https://"
"zammad.com/en/pricing){target=_blank}."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:27
msgid ""
"To follow the installation steps below, tools like curl, gnupg and others "
"are required. If they are not present on your system, install them:"
msgstr ""
"Да бисте пратили кораке инсталације испод, потребни су алати као што су "
"цурл, гнупг и други. Ако их нема на вашем систему, инсталирајте их:"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install curl apt-transport-https gnupg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install curl apt-transport-https gnupg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"OpenSUSE doesn't require any additional steps here!\n"
"\n"
"SLES 15 requires additional repositories to be activated. To do so, run the following commands.\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo SUSEConnect --product sle-module-desktop-applications/$(. /etc/os-release; echo $VERSION_ID)/$(uname -i)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo SUSEConnect --product PackageHub/$(. /etc/os-release; echo $VERSION_ID)/$(uname -i)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf install curl epel-release\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install curl apt-transport-https gnupg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install curl apt-transport-https gnupg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"Само SLES - није обавезно за OpenSUSE:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo SUSEConnect --product sle-module-desktop-applications/$(. /etc/os-release; echo $VERSION_ID)/$(uname -i)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo SUSEConnect --product PackageHub/$(. /etc/os-release; echo $VERSION_ID)/$(uname -i)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo yum install wget epel-release\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure correct locale"
msgstr "Обезбедите исправан locale"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:68
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"List your current locale settings:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"If above does not return `<lang_code>.utf8`, you can correct this\n"
"issue as follows:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install locales\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo locale-gen en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"echo \"LANG=en_US.UTF-8\" > sudo /etc/default/locale\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"After fixing it, make sure to check the output again for including\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. A reboot may help if unsuccessful.\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"List your current locale settings:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"If above does not return `<lang_code>.utf8`, you can correct this\n"
"issue as follows:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install locales\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo locale-gen en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"echo \"LANG=en_US.UTF-8\" > sudo /etc/default/locale\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"After fixing it, make sure to check the output again for including\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. A reboot may help if unsuccessful.\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"List your current locale settings:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"localectl status | grep LANG\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"If above does not return `<lang_code>.utf8`, you can correct this\n"
"issue as follows:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo localectl set-locale LANG=en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"After fixing it, make sure to check the output again for including\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. A reboot may help if unsuccessful.\n"
"\n"
"===CentOS/RHEL\n"
"List your current locale settings:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"If above does not return `<lang_code>.utf8`, you can correct this\n"
"issue as follows:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo localectl set-locale LANG=en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"After fixing it, make sure to check the output again for including\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. A reboot may help if unsuccessful.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"Излистајте ваша тренутна locale подешавања:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Уколико горња команда не врати `<lang_code>.utf8`, ово можете исправити\n"
"на следећи начин:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install locales\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo locale-gen en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"echo \"LANG=en_US.UTF-8\" > sudo /etc/default/locale\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Након промене, обавезно поново излистајте подешавање и проверите да ли враћа\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. Уколико буде неуспешно, рестартовање може помоћи.\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"Излистајте ваша тренутна locale подешавања:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Уколико горња команда не врати `<lang_code>.utf8`, ово можете исправити\n"
"на следећи начин:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install locales\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo locale-gen en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"echo \"LANG=en_US.UTF-8\" > sudo /etc/default/locale\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Након промене, обавезно поново излистајте подешавање и проверите да ли враћа\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. Уколико буде неуспешно, рестартовање може помоћи.\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"Излистајте ваша тренутна locale подешавања:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"localectl status | grep LANG\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Уколико горња команда не врати `<lang_code>.utf8`, ово можете исправити\n"
"на следећи начин:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo localectl set-locale LANG=en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Након промене, обавезно поново излистајте подешавање и проверите да ли враћа\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. Уколико буде неуспешно, рестартовање може помоћи.\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"Излистајте ваша тренутна locale подешавања:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"locale | grep \"LANG=\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Уколико горња команда не врати `<lang_code>.utf8`, ово можете исправити\n"
"на следећи начин:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo localectl set-locale LANG=en_US.UTF-8\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Након промене, обавезно поново излистајте подешавање и проверите да ли враћа\n"
"`<lang_code>.utf8`. Уколико буде неуспешно, рестартовање може помоћи.\n"
"\n"

