#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Single sign-on with Kerberos"
msgstr "Јединствена пријава са Керберосом"

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Single sign-on for Kerberos <Badge type=\"warning\" text=\"on-premise only\"/>"
msgstr "Одељак са значком <Badge type=\"warning\" text=\"прилагођен текст\" />"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:10
msgid ""
"This guide will discuss how to set up single sign-on using Microsoft Active "
"Directory."
msgstr ""
"Овај водич ће објаснити како поставити јединствену пријаву коришћењем "
"Microsoft Active Directoryja."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conceptual overview"
msgstr "Преглед функција"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:16
msgid ""
"Like every other web application out there, Zammad has its own logic for "
"signing users up, storing their passwords, authenticating them, and managing "
"their sessions."
msgstr ""
"Као и свака друга веб апликација, Zammad има сопствену логику за "
"регистрацију корисника, чување лозинки, аутентификацију и управљање сесијама."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:22
msgid ""
"If your IT department keeps its own user identity store (like Active "
"Directory), Zammad's SSO support allows you to leverage that existing auth "
"system so that anyone with an account on your local intranet will 1) "
"automatically have an account in Zammad and 2) be able to log in with a "
"single click."
msgstr ""
"Ако ваше IT одељење одржава сопствено складиште идентитета корисника (попут "
"Active Directoryja), SSO подршка у Zammad-у омогућава искоришћавање тог "
"постојећег система аутентификације, тако да свако ко има налог на вашој "
"локалној интранету 1) аутоматски ће имати налог у Zammad-у и 2) моћи ће да "
"се пријави једним кликом."

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you don't have this IT infrastructure but still want one-click\n"
"login, you can use alternatives like Github, Google, Facebook and more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ако немате ову IT инфраструктуру, али желите пријаву једним кликом,\n"
"могуће је користити алтернативе као што су GitHub, Google, Facebook и друге.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "How does it work?"
msgstr "Како то уствари функционише?"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:34
msgid ""
"Once enabled, single sign-on activates an endpoint at `https://"
"your.zammad.host/auth/sso`. When the Zammad server receives a GET request at "
"this endpoint with a valid username in **any one of the following** "
"entities, it creates a new session for that user:"
msgstr ""
"Након активирања, јединствена пријава омогућава ендпоинт на `https://"
"your.zammad.host/auth/sso`. Када Zammad сервер прими GET захтев на овом "
"ендпоинту са валидним корисничким именом у **било ком** од следећих поља, "
"креира нову сесију за тог корисника:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:38
msgid "an `X-Forwarded-User` request header"
msgstr "`X-Forwarded-User` заглавље захтева"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:38
msgid "a `REMOTE_USER` web server environment variable"
msgstr "променљива окружења веб сервера `REMOTE_USER`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:38
msgid "an `HTTP_REMOTE_USER` web server environment variable"
msgstr "променљива окружења веб сервера `HTTP_REMOTE_USER`"

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Wait. SSO allows you to sign in with only a username?**\n"
"\n"
"In principle, yes.\n"
"\n"
"**How is that okay?**\n"
"\n"
"In this guide, we configure our web server (Apache) to intercept all\n"
"requests to the `/auth/sso` endpoint. Instead of forwarding them to\n"
"Zammad, Apache initiates a three-sided login process (_Kerberos\n"
"authentication_) between the itself, the user, and the Active\n"
"Directory server.\n"
"\n"
"If Active Directory doesn't recognize the user or their password,\n"
"Zammad never sees the request, and the session is never created.\n"
"\n"
"**What does this all mean?**\n"
"\n"
"It means there are many ways you could set up SSO—you don't need to\n"
"follow this guide or even use Active Directory or Kerberos—but if you\n"
"don't know what you're doing, you're going to end up with a _massive_\n"
"security hole.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Чек. SSO омогућава пријаву само корисничким именом?**\n"
"\n"
"У принципу, да.\n"
"\n"
"**Како је то у реду?**\n"
"\n"
"У овом водичу конфигурисали смо веб сервер (Apache) да прекине све\n"
"захтеве ка `/auth/sso` ендпоинту. Уместо да их проследи на\n"
"Zammad, Apache иницира процес пријаве са три стране (_Kerberos\n"
"аутентификација_) између себе, корисника и сервера Active\n"
"Directoryja.\n"
"\n"
"Ако Active Directory не препозна корисника или његову лозинку,\n"
"Zammad никада не види захтев и сесија се никада не креира.\n"
"\n"
"**Шта све ово значи?**\n"
"\n"
"То значи да постоји много начина како можете поставити SSO—не морате\n"
"пратити овај водич нити користити Active Directory или Kerberos—али ако\n"
"не знате шта радите, на крају ћете имати _огроман_\n"
"пропуст у безбедности.\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Too busy to handle it on your own?**\n"
"\n"
"We've got you covered. Our experts offer custom-tailored workshops to\n"
"get your team up and running fast and with confidence.\n"
"[Just drop us a line](https://zammad.com/contact){target=_blank}!\n"
msgstr ""
"**Превише сте заузети да то урадите сами?**\n"
"\n"
"Ту смо за вас. Наши стручњаци нуде прилагођене радионице које ће ваш тим брзо покренути и оснажити.\n"
"[Јавите нам се](https://zammad.com/contact){target=_blank}!\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:74
msgid "You will need:"
msgstr "Требаће вам:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:82
msgid "a Microsoft Active Directory environment with"
msgstr "Microsoft Active Directory окружење са"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:82
msgid "root access"
msgstr "роот приступ"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:82
msgid "support for AES 256-bit encryption"
msgstr "подршка за AES енкрипцију на 256 бита"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:82
msgid "a Zammad host with"
msgstr "Додајте Zammad репозиториј"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:82
msgid "a fully-qualified domain name (FQDN)"
msgstr "комплетно квалификовано име домена (FQDN)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:82
msgid "some familiarity with system administration (e.g. Apache configuration)"
msgstr "одређено познавање администрације система (нпр. конфигурација Апацха)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:87
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For best results, set up the LDAP integration to make sure\n"
"your Active Directory and Zammad user accounts are always in sync. You\n"
"can find it in Zammad's admin interface under\n"
"_Settings > Security > Third-party Applications_.\n"
msgstr ""
"За најбоље резултате подесите LDAP интеграцију како бисте осигурали да су ваши Active Directory и Zammad налози увек синхронизовани. Можете је пронаћи у админ интерфејсу Zammad-а под\n"
"_Settings > Security > Third-party Applications_.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Configure active directory"
msgstr "Корак 1: Клонирање GitHub репозиторија"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:94
msgid ""
"In the Kerberos authentication scheme, the **authentication server** (Active "
"Directory) needs to maintain shared secrets with the **service** (Zammad). "
"To make this possible, we need to register a **service principal name** "
"(SPN) for Zammad on Active Directory."
msgstr ""
"У Kerberos шеми аутентификације, **сервер за аутентификацију** (Active "
"Directory) мора да одржава заједничке тајне са **услугом** (Zammad). Да би "
"се то омогућило, на Active Directory-u морамо регистровати **сервице "
"принципал наме** (SPN) за Zammad."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "These directions have been confirmed on Windows Server 2016.\n"
msgstr "Ове упуте су потврђене на Windows Серверу 2016.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "1a. Create a service account"
msgstr "1a. Креирајте сервисни налог"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:103
msgid ""
"You may use an existing service account if you have one. Admin privileges "
"are not required; a normal user account will do."
msgstr ""
"Можете искористити постојећи сервисни налог ако га имате. Администратор "
"овлашћења нису потребна; обичан кориснички налог је довољан."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:105
msgid ""
"![Screenshot Active Directory service account settings](/screenshots/"
"tutorials/sso-kerberos/active-directory-service-account-settings.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Skrinsot podešavanja servisnog naloga u Active Directory-u](/screenshots/"
"tutorials/sso-kerberos/active-directory-service-account-settings.png)"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "1b. Reset password"
msgstr "1b. Ресетуј лозинку"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:110
msgid ""
"Reset service account password after enabling the \"This account supports "
"Kerberos AES 256 bit encryption\"."
msgstr ""
"Ресетујте лозинку сервисног налога након укључивања опције \"Овај налог "
"подржава Kerberos AES 256 бит енкрипцију\"."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "1c. Register a SPN for Zammad"
msgstr "1c. Региструјте SPN за Zammad"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:114 src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:351
msgid "Replace the following placeholders in the commands below:"
msgstr "Замените следеће плацехолдер-е у командама испод:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:121 src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:356
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:438
msgid "`<zammad-host>`: Zammad FQDN"
msgstr "`<zammad-host>`: Zammad FQDN"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:121
msgid "`<service-acct>`: Service account logon name"
msgstr "`<service-acct>`: Корисничко име за пријаву сервисног налога"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:121
msgid ""
"`<password>`: Password of the service account (Option `/pass *` did prove to "
"not work)"
msgstr ""
"`<password>`: Лозинка сервисног налога (Опција `/pass *` се показала као "
"нефункционална)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:121 src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:311
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:356 src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:438
msgid "`<domain>`: Windows domain"
msgstr "`<domain>`: Windows домен"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:121
msgid "`<master-domain-controller>`: Master domain controller IP/FQD"
msgstr "`<master-domain-controller>`: IP/FQD master доменског контролера"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:123
msgid "The commands below will prompt for the users password:"
msgstr "Команде испод ће тражити лозинку корисника:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:124
#, no-wrap
msgid "setspn -s HTTP/<zammad-host> <service-acct>\n"
msgstr "setspn -s HTTP/<zammad-host> <service-acct>\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:128
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ktpass /princ HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN> \\\n"
"        /mapuser <service-acct> \\\n"
"        /crypto AES256-SHA1 \\\n"
"        /ptype KRB5_NT_PRINCIPAL \\\n"
"        /pass <password> -SetPass +DumpSalt \\\n"
"        /target <master-domain-controller> \\\n"
"        /out zammad.keytab\n"
msgstr ""
"ktpass /princ HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN> \\\n"
"        /mapuser <service-acct> \\\n"
"        /crypto AES256-SHA1 \\\n"
"        /ptype KRB5_NT_PRINCIPAL \\\n"
"        /pass <password> -SetPass +DumpSalt \\\n"
"        /target <master-domain-controller> \\\n"
"        /out zammad.keytab\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:138
#, no-wrap
msgid "1d. Note the secret key and version number"
msgstr "1d. Забележите тајни кључ и верзионски број"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:142
msgid ""
"The output of the command above contains important data for Step 2e below:"
msgstr "Излаз горње команде садржи важне податке за Корак 2e испод:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:143
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Using legacy password setting method\n"
"Failed to set property 'servicePrincipalName' to 'HTTP/<zammad-host>' on Dn 'CN=Zammad Service,DC=<domain>,DC=<tld>': 0x13.\n"
"WARNING: Unable to set SPN mapping data.\n"
"If <service-acct> already has an SPN mapping installed for HTTP/<zammad-host>, this is no cause for concern.\n"
"Building salt with principalname HTTP/<zammad-host> and domain <domain> (encryption type 18)...\n"
"Hashing password with salt \"<domain><service-acct>\".\n"
"Key created.\n"
"Output keytab to zammad.keytab:\n"
"Keytab version: 0x502\n"
"keysize 67 <service-acct>@<domain> ptype 1 (KRB5_NT_PRINCIPAL) vno 3 etype 0x12 (AES256-SHA1) keylength 32 (0x5ee827c30c736dd4095c9cbe146eabc216415b1ddb134db6aabd61be8fdf7fb1) # [!code focus]\n"
msgstr ""
"Using legacy password setting method\n"
"Failed to set property 'servicePrincipalName' to 'HTTP/<zammad-host>' on Dn 'CN=Zammad Service,DC=<domain>,DC=<tld>': 0x13.\n"
"WARNING: Unable to set SPN mapping data.\n"
"If <service-acct> already has an SPN mapping installed for HTTP/<zammad-host>, this is no cause for concern.\n"
"Building salt with principalname HTTP/<zammad-host> and domain <domain> (encryption type 18)...\n"
"Hashing password with salt \"<domain><service-acct>\".\n"
"Key created.\n"
"Output keytab to zammad.keytab:\n"
"Keytab version: 0x502\n"
"keysize 67 <service-acct>@<domain> ptype 1 (KRB5_NT_PRINCIPAL) vno 3 etype 0x12 (AES256-SHA1) keylength 32 (0x5ee827c30c736dd4095c9cbe146eabc216415b1ddb134db6aabd61be8fdf7fb1) # [!code focus]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:157
msgid "On the last line, take note of:"
msgstr "На последњој линији, обратите пажњу на:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:160
msgid "the secret key in parentheses at the end (**0x5ee827...**)"
msgstr "тајни кључ у загради на крају (**0x5ee827...**)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:160
msgid "the secret key version number preceded by `vno` (**3**)"
msgstr "верзионски број тајног кључа који претходи `vno` (**3**)"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:161
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Remove NGINX, set up Apache + Kerberos"
msgstr "Корак 2: Уклоните NGINX, подесите Apache + Kerberos"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:165
msgid ""
"Next, the Zammad host must be configured to support Kerberos (and to accept "
"auth credentials provided by the Active Directory server)."
msgstr ""
"Затим, хост за Zammad мора бити конфигурисан да подржава Kerberos (и да "
"прихвати аутентификационе креденцијале које пружа Active Directory сервер)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:169
msgid ""
"In most cases, you would have to recompile NGINX from source with an extra "
"module to enable Kerberos support. To get around this, we will use Apache, "
"which offers Kerberos support through a plug-in module instead."
msgstr ""
"У већини случајева морали бисте прецомпајлирати NGINX из изворног кода са "
"додатним модулом да омогућите подршку за Kerberos. Да бисмо заобишли овај "
"проблем, користићемо Apache, који нуди подршку за Kerberos путем плугин "
"модула."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:170
#, no-wrap
msgid "All commands in this section must be run as root (or with `sudo`).\n"
msgstr "Све команде у овом одељку морају се извршити као роот (или са `sudo`).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:174
#, no-wrap
msgid "2a. Turn off NGINX"
msgstr "2a. Искључите NGINX"

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:176
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This will take your Zammad instance **offline** until Apache is fully\n"
"configured and running.\n"
msgstr "Ово ће довести вашу Zammad инстанцу **оффлине** док се Apache у потпуности не конфигурише и не покрене.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:182
msgid "Turn off Nginx:"
msgstr "Искључите Nginx:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:183
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl stop nginx\n"
msgstr "systemctl стоп nginx\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:188
msgid "Keep it off after reboot:"
msgstr "Задржите искљученим након поновног покретања:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:189
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl disable nginx\n"
msgstr "$ systemctl дисабле nginx\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:196
msgid ""
"If you wish to minimize downtime, you can save this step for last; just bear "
"in mind that Apache will not start if the port it wants to listen on is "
"being used by NGINX."
msgstr ""
"Ако желите да смањите време неактивности, овај корак можете оставити за "
"крај; само имајте на уму да се Apache неће покренути ако порт који жели да "
"користи већ користи NGINX."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:199
msgid ""
"If you can't complete this tutorial for any reason, simply turn off Apache "
"and restore NGINX:"
msgstr ""
"Ако из било ког разлога не можете да довршите овај водич, једноставно "
"искључите Apache и поново активирајте NGINX:"

#. type: Fenced div block (details)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:200
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl stop apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl disable apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl enable nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl start nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl stop apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl disable apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl enable nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl start nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:220
#, no-wrap
msgid "2b. Pre-configure Apache"
msgstr "2b. Предконфигурација Apache-а"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:226
msgid ""
"This documentation expects an already working Apache configuration.  You "
"should have a look at the [webserver configuration guide](/en/tutorials/"
"webserver-config) before continuing."
msgstr ""
"Ова документација подразумева већ функционалну Apache конфигурацију. Пре "
"наставка, погледајте водич за [конфигурацију web сервера](/en/tutorials/"
"webserver-config)."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:227
#, no-wrap
msgid "2c. Install further Apache dependencies"
msgstr "2c. Инсталирајте додатне зависности за Apache"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:229
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install krb5-user libapache2-mod-auth-gssapi\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo yum install krb5-workstation mod_auth_kerb\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper ref\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper install krb5-client apache2-mod_auth_kerb\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install krb5-user libapache2-mod-auth-gssapi\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo yum install krb5-workstation mod_auth_kerb\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper ref\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper install krb5-client apache2-mod_auth_kerb\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:259
#, no-wrap
msgid "2d. Enable Apache modules"
msgstr "2d. Омогућите Apache модуле"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:263
msgid ""
"SSO requires modules that are not enabled by default. By default you can use "
"`a2enmod` to do so."
msgstr ""
"SSO захтева модуле који нису омогућени подразумевано. Подразумевано можете "
"искористити `a2enmod` за ту сврху."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:264
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== a2enmod (Debian & Ubuntu)\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2enmod auth_gssapi rewrite\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== a2enmod (OpenSUSE)\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2enmod auth_kerb rewrite\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== via configuration file (CentOS)\n"
"\n"
"add/uncomment the appropriate `LoadModule` statements in your Apache\n"
"config:\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"# /etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf\n"
"\n"
"LoadModule auth_kerb_module /usr/lib/apache2/modules/mod_auth_kerb.so\n"
"LoadModule rewrite_module modules/mod_rewrite.so\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== a2enmod (Debian & Ubuntu)\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2enmod auth_gssapi rewrite\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== a2enmod (OpenSUSE)\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2enmod auth_kerb rewrite\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== виа цонфигуратион филе (CentOS)\n"
"\n"
"Додајте или укључите одговарајуће `LoadModule` директиве у вашој Apache конфигурацији:\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"# /etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf\n"
"\n"
"LoadModule auth_kerb_module /usr/lib/apache2/modules/mod_auth_kerb.so\n"
"LoadModule rewrite_module modules/mod_rewrite.so\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:300
#, no-wrap
msgid "2e. Configure Kerberos"
msgstr "2e. Конфигуришите Kerberos"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:304
msgid ""
"Kerberos realm configuration is how you tell the Zammad server how to reach "
"the _domain controller_ (Active Directory server)."
msgstr ""
"Конфигурација Kerberos домене одређује начин на који ће Zammad сервер "
"комуницирати са _контролером домене_ (сервером Active Directory)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:306
msgid "Replace the following placeholders in the sample config below:"
msgstr "Замените следеће плацехолдер-е у примеру конфигурације испод:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:311
msgid "`<domain-controller>`: Domain controller IP/FQDN(s)"
msgstr "`<domain-controller>`: IP/FQDN(и) контролера домене"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:311
msgid ""
"`<master-domain-controller>`: Master domain controller IP/FQDN (must not be "
"read-only, but can be the same as `<domain-controller>`)"
msgstr ""
"`<master-domain-controller>`: IP/FQDN главног контролера домене (не сме бити "
"само за читање, али може бити исти као `<domain-controller>`)"

#. type: Fenced code block (ini)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:312
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# /etc/krb5.conf\n"
"\n"
"[libdefaults]\n"
"   default_realm = <DOMAIN>\n"
"\n"
"   default_tkt_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"   default_tgs_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"   permitted_enctypes = aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96\n"
"\n"
"   kdc_timesync = 1\n"
"   ccache_type = 4\n"
"   forwardable = false\n"
"   proxiable = false\n"
"   fcc-mit-ticketflags = false\n"
"\n"
"[realms]\n"
"         # multiple KDCs ok (one `kdc = ...` definition per line)\n"
"         <DOMAIN> = {\n"
"                  kdc = <domain-controller>\n"
"                  admin_server = <master-domain-controller>\n"
"                  default_domain = <domain>\n"
"\n"
"                  # below is only for GSSAPI\n"
"                  auth_to_local = RULE:[1:$1@$0](.*@<domain>)s/@<domain>$//\n"
"                  auth_to_local = DEFAULT\n"
"         }\n"
"\n"
"[domain_realm]\n"
"         .<domain> = <DOMAIN>\n"
"         <domain> = <DOMAIN>\n"
msgstr ""
"# /etc/krb5.conf\n"
"\n"
"[либдефаултс]\n"
"   дефаулт_реалм = <DOMAIN>\n"
"\n"
"   default_tkt_enctypes = aes256-цтс-хмац-sha1-96\n"
"   default_tgs_enctypes = aes256-цтс-хмац-sha1-96\n"
"   permitted_enctypes = aes256-цтс-хмац-sha1-96\n"
"\n"
"   kdc_timesync = 1\n"
"   ccache_type = 4\n"
"   forwardable = фалсе\n"
"   proxiable = фалсе\n"
"   фцц-мит-тицкетфлагс = фалсе\n"
"\n"
"[реалмс]\n"
"         # више КДЦ дозвољено (једна `kdc = ...` дефиниција по линији)\n"
"         <DOMAIN> = {\n"
"                  кдц = <domain-controller>\n"
"                  админ_сервер = <master-domain-controller>\n"
"                  дефаулт_домаин = <domain>\n"
"\n"
"                  # испод важи само за GSSAPI\n"
"                  аутх_то_лоцал = RULE:[1:$1@$0](.*@<domain>)с/@<domain>$//\n"
"                  аутх_то_лоцал = DEFAULT\n"
"         }\n"
"\n"
"[домаин_реалм]\n"
"         .<domain> = <DOMAIN>\n"
"         <domain> = <DOMAIN>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:345
#, no-wrap
msgid "2f. Generate keytab"
msgstr "2f. Генеришите keytab"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:349
msgid ""
"Apache needs a Kerberos _keytab_ (key table) to manage its shared secrets "
"with the domain controller."
msgstr ""
"Apache-у је потребан Kerberos _keytab_ (табела кључева) за управљање "
"заједничким тајнама са контролером домене."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:356
msgid "`<secret-key>`: Secret key (**omit the leading** `0x`)"
msgstr "`<secret-key>`: Тајни кључ (**изоставите почетно** `0x`)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:356
msgid "`<vno>`: Secret key version number"
msgstr "`<vno>`: Верзија тајног кључа"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:359
msgid ""
"The secret key and version number were found in `sso-register-spn` (Step "
"1d)  above."
msgstr ""
"Тајни кључ и број верзије пронађени су у `sso-register-spn` (Корак 1d) изнад."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:361
msgid "Enter ktutil:"
msgstr "Унесите команду ктутил:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:362
#, no-wrap
msgid "ktutil\n"
msgstr "ktutil\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:367
msgid "Add keytab:"
msgstr "Додајте keytab:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:368
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ktutil: addent -key -p HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN> -k <vno> -e aes256-cts\n"
"Key for HTTP/<zammad-host>@<domain> (hex): <secret-key>\n"
msgstr ""
"ktutil: addent -key -p HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN> -k <vno> -e aes256-cts\n"
"Key for HTTP/<zammad-host>@<domain> (hex): <secret-key>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:374
msgid "Confirm the entry was added successfully:"
msgstr "Потврдите да је унос успешно додат:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:375
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ktutil: list\n"
"slot KVNO Principal\n"
"---- ---- ---------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"   1    3 HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>\n"
msgstr ""
"ktutil: list\n"
"slot KVNO Principal\n"
"---- ---- ---------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"   1    3 HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:383
msgid "Write keytab to disk:"
msgstr "Запишите keytab на диск:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:384
#, no-wrap
msgid "ktutil: wkt /root/zammad.keytab\n"
msgstr "ktutil: wkt /root/zammad.keytab\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:389
msgid "Leave ktutil:"
msgstr "Напустите ктутил:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:390
#, no-wrap
msgid "ktutil: quit\n"
msgstr "ktutil: quit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:396
msgid ""
"Then, place the keytab in the Apache config directory and set the "
"appropriate permissions:"
msgstr ""
"Затим, поставите keytab у директоријум за конфигурацију Apache-а и подесите "
"одговарајућа права:"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:397
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Debian, Ubuntu, OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo mv /root/zammad.keytab /etc/apache2/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chown root:www-data /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chmod 640 /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo mv /root/zammad.keytab /etc/httpd/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chown root:apache /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chmod 640 /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Debian, Ubuntu, OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo mv /root/zammad.keytab /etc/apache2/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chown root:www-data /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chmod 640 /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo mv /root/zammad.keytab /etc/httpd/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chown root:apache /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo chmod 640 /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:429
#, no-wrap
msgid "2g. Configure Apache"
msgstr "2g. Конфигуришите Apache"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:433
msgid ""
"Add the following directive to the end of the virtual host configuration "
"file to create your Kerberos SSO endpoint at `/auth/sso`:"
msgstr ""
"Додајте следећу директиву на крај датотеке конфигурације виртуелног домена "
"да бисте креирали своју Kerberos SSO крајњу тачку на `/auth/sso`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:435
msgid "Replace the following placeholders in the command below:"
msgstr "Замените следеће плацехолдер-е у конфигурацији испод:"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:439
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"``` apache\n"
"# /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"\n"
"<LocationMatch \"/auth/sso\">\n"
"   SSLRequireSSL\n"
"   AuthType GSSAPI\n"
"   AuthName \"Your Zammad\"\n"
"   GssapiBasicAuth On\n"
"   GssapiCredStore keytab:/etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"   GssapiLocalName On\n"
"   require valid-user\n"
"\n"
"   RewriteEngine On\n"
"   RewriteCond %{LA-U:REMOTE_USER} (.+)\n"
"   RewriteRule . - [E=RU:%1,NS]\n"
"   RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-User \"%{RU}e\" env=RU\n"
"</LocationMatch>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS & OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"The configuration for CentOS and OpenSUSE below contains two\n"
"`Krb5KeyTab` lines! Keep only the one you need.\n"
"\n"
"``` apache\n"
"# /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"\n"
"<LocationMatch \"/auth/sso\">\n"
"   SSLRequireSSL\n"
"   AuthType Kerberos\n"
"   AuthName \"Your Zammad\"\n"
"   KrbMethodNegotiate On\n"
"   KrbVerifyKDC On\n"
"   KrbMethodK5Passwd On\n"
"   KrbAuthRealms <DOMAIN>\n"
"   KrbLocalUserMapping on                 # strips @REALM suffix from REMOTE_USER variable\n"
"   KrbServiceName HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>\n"
"   Krb5KeyTab /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab  # Ubuntu, Debian, & openSUSE\n"
"   Krb5KeyTab /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab    # CentOS\n"
"   require valid-user\n"
"\n"
"   RewriteEngine On\n"
"   RewriteCond %{LA-U:REMOTE_USER} (.+)\n"
"   RewriteRule . - [E=RU:%1,NS]\n"
"   RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-User \"%{RU}e\" env=RU\n"
"</LocationMatch>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"``` apache\n"
"# /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"\n"
"<LocationMatch \"/auth/sso\">\n"
"   SSLRequireSSL\n"
"   AuthType GSSAPI\n"
"   AuthName \"Vaš Zammad\"\n"
"   GssapiBasicAuth On\n"
"   GssapiCredStore keytab:/etc/apache2/zammad.keytab\n"
"   GssapiLocalName On\n"
"   require valid-user\n"
"\n"
"   RewriteEngine On\n"
"   RewriteCond %{LA-U:REMOTE_USER} (.+)\n"
"   RewriteRule . - [E=RU:%1,NS]\n"
"   RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-User \"%{RU}e\" env=RU\n"
"</LocationMatch>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS & OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"Концепција за CentOS и опенСУСЕ испод садржи две\n"
"`Krb5KeyTab` линије! Задржите само ону коју вам треба.\n"
"\n"
"``` apache\n"
"# /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"\n"
"<LocationMatch \"/auth/sso\">\n"
"   SSLRequireSSL\n"
"   AuthType Kerberos\n"
"   AuthName \"Vaš Zammad\"\n"
"   KrbMethodNegotiate On\n"
"   KrbVerifyKDC On\n"
"   KrbMethodK5Passwd On\n"
"   KrbAuthRealms <DOMAIN>\n"
"   KrbLocalUserMapping on                 # uklanja @REALM sufiks iz promenljive REMOTE_USER\n"
"   KrbServiceName HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>\n"
"   Krb5KeyTab /etc/apache2/zammad.keytab  # Ubuntu, Debian i openSUSE\n"
"   Krb5KeyTab /etc/httpd/zammad.keytab    # CentOS\n"
"   require valid-user\n"
"\n"
"   RewriteEngine On\n"
"   RewriteCond %{LA-U:REMOTE_USER} (.+)\n"
"   RewriteRule . - [E=RU:%1,NS]\n"
"   RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-User \"%{RU}e\" env=RU\n"
"</LocationMatch>\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:493
#, no-wrap
msgid "2g. Restart Apache to apply changes"
msgstr "2g. Рестартујте Apache да примените промене"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:495
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
msgstr "systemctl рестарт apache2\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:499
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Enable SSO in Zammad"
msgstr "Корак 3: Укључите SSO пријаву за Zammad"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:503
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, enable \"Authentication via SSO\" in Zammad's Admin Panel under\n"
"_Settings > Security > Third-party Applications_\n"
msgstr ""
"Затим, омогућите \"Аутентификацију путем SSO\" у Администраторском панелу Zammad-а под\n"
"_Сетиње > Безбедност > Апликације трећих страна_\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:504
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On older versions of Zammad, visit `https://your.zammad.host/auth/sso`\n"
"to sign in.\n"
msgstr ""
"На старијим верзијама Zammad-а посетите `https://vaš.zammad.host/auth/sso`\n"
"да се пријавите.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:509
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Configure client system (Windows only)"
msgstr "Корак 4: Конфигуришите клијентски систем (само за Windows)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:513
msgid ""
"For the full SSO experience (i.e. for passwordless one-click sign-in), "
"Zammad users must:"
msgstr ""
"За потпуно искуство SSO (односно, пријаву једним кликом без лозинке), "
"корисници Zammad-а морају:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:517
msgid "be on the Active Directory server's local intranet; and"
msgstr "бити на локалном интранету сервера Active Directory; и"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:517
msgid ""
"modify their network settings for the Zammad host to be treated as a local "
"intranet server."
msgstr ""
"изменити своја мрежна подешавања за домаћина Zammad-а да би се третирао као "
"сервер локалног интранета."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:520
msgid ""
"Without this step, users must enter their Active Directory credentials "
"during SSO."
msgstr ""
"Без овог корака, корисници морају унети своја креденцијала Active Directory "
"током SSO."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== IE / Edge / Chromium\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== IE / Edge / Chromium\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This setting can be centrally managed across the entire intranet using\n"
"a **group policy object** (GPO).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ово подешавање се може централно управљати на целом интранету користећи\n"
"**објекат групне политике** (GPO).\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"1. Add your Zammad FQDN in Internet Options under _Security > Local\n"
"   Intranet > Sites > Advanced_.\n"
"2. Select \"Require server verification (https:) for all sites in this\n"
"   zone\".\n"
"3. Under _Security level for this zone > Custom level... > Settings\n"
"   \\> User Authentication > Logon_, select \"Automatic logon only in\n"
"   Intranet Zone\".\n"
"\n"
"=== Firefox\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"1. У Опцијама интернета додајте FQDN свог Zammad-а под _Безбедност > Локални\n"
"   интранет > Сајтови > Напредно_.\n"
"2. Означите \"Захтевај проверу сервера (хттпс:) за све сајтове у овој\n"
"   зони\".\n"
"3. У оквиру _Ниво безбедности за ову зону > Прилагођени ниво... > Подешавања\n"
"   \\> Корисничка аутентификација > Пријава_, изаберите \"Аутоматска пријава само у\n"
"   зони интранета\".\n"
"\n"
"=== Firefox\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|info)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This option cannot be centrally managed because it is set in the\n"
"browser rather than Windows Settings.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ова опција се не може централно управљати јер се подешава у\n"
"претраживачу, а не у Windows Подешавањима.\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:521
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"1. Enter `about:config` in the address bar. Click **Accept the risk and\n"
"   continue**.\n"
"2. Search for the `network.negotiate-auth.trusted-uris` option.\n"
"3. Double-click to edit, then add your Zammad FQDN.\n"
"4. Restart Firefox to apply your changes.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"1. У адресну траку унесите `about:config`. Кликните **Прихваташ ризик и\n"
"   настављам**.\n"
"2. Пронађите опцију `network.negotiate-auth.trusted-uris`.\n"
"3. Двапут кликните за уређивање и додајте FQDN свог Zammad-а.\n"
"4. Рестартујте Firefox да примените промене.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:560
msgid ""
"Are all relevant FQDNs/hostnames reachable from your Active Directory and "
"Zammad servers (including each other's)?"
msgstr ""
"Да ли су сви релевантни FQDN/хостнаме-и доступни са сервера Active Directory "
"и Zammad (укључујући међусобно)?"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:560
msgid ""
"Are the system clocks of your Active Directory and Zammad servers "
"synchronized within five minutes of each other? Kerberos is a time-sensitive "
"protocol!"
msgstr ""
"Да ли су системски сатови сервера Active Directory и Zammad синхронизовани у "
"оквиру пет минута један од другог? Kerberos је протокол осетљив на време!"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:561
#, no-wrap
msgid "Errors in Apache logs"
msgstr "Грешке у Apache логовима"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:563
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Try raising your Apache log level temporarily.**\n"
"\n"
"Add `LogLevel debug` to your virtual host configuration, then restart\n"
"the service to apply the changes.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Покушајте привремено повисити ниво логовања Apache-а.**\n"
"\n"
"Додајте `LogLevel debug` у конфигурацију виртуелног домена, затим рестартујте\n"
"сервис да примените промене.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:570
#, no-wrap
msgid "An unsupported mechanism was requested"
msgstr "Затражен је неподржан механизам"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:574
msgid ""
"Does your Active Directory service account have **Kerberos AES 256-bit "
"encryption** enabled?"
msgstr ""
"Да ли ваш сервисни налог Active Directory има омогућено **Kerberos AES "
"енкрипцију од 256 бита**?"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:578
msgid ""
"If for some reason your server does not support AES 256-bit encryption, the "
"LDAP Wiki has [more information about Kerberos encryption types](https://"
"ldapwiki.com/wiki/MsDS-SupportedEncryptionTypes){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Ако из неког разлога ваш сервер не подржава AES енкрипцију од 256 бита, LDAP "
"Wiki пружа [више информација о типовима Kerberos енкрипције](https://"
"ldapwiki.com/wiki/MsDS-SupportedEncryptionTypes){target=_blank}."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:579
#, no-wrap
msgid "Failed to verify krb5 credentials: Key version is not available"
msgstr "Неуспешна провера krb5 креденцијала: Верзија кључа није доступна"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:583
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Did you use the exact **version number** (`vno`) provided by `ktpass`\n"
"when `generating your keytab <sso-generate-keytab>`?\n"
msgstr ""
"Да ли сте користили тачан **број верзије** (`vno`) који је пружио `ktpass`\n"
"приликом `generisanja vašeg keytab-a <sso-generate-keytab>`?\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:585 src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:592
msgid "Try generating it again, just to be sure."
msgstr "Покушајте да га поново генеришете, само да будете сигурни."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:586
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unspecified GSS failure. Minor code may provide more information (, no key table entry found for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN)"
msgstr "Непозната грешка GSS-а. Мањи код може пружити више информација (, Није пронађен унос у табели кључева за HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:590
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Does the **service name** you provided to `setspn` exactly match the one\n"
"you used when `generating your keytab <sso-generate-keytab>`?\n"
msgstr ""
"Да ли се **назив сервиса** који сте унели у `setspn` тачно поклапа са оним\n"
"који сте користили приликом `generisanja vašeg keytab-a <sso-generate-keytab>`?\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:593
#, no-wrap
msgid "No key table entry found for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN"
msgstr "Запис у keytab-u за HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN није пронађен"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:597
msgid ""
"Does your virtual host configuration's `KrbServiceName` setting exactly "
"match the **service name** you provided to `setspn`?"
msgstr ""
"Да ли подешавање `KrbServiceName` ваше конфигурације виртуелног домаћина "
"тачно одговара **називу сервиса** који сте унели у `setspn`?"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:599
msgid "This setting is case-sensitive."
msgstr "Подешавање је осетљиво на велика и мала слова."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:600
#, no-wrap
msgid "Warning: Received token seems to be NTLM, which isn't supported by the Kerberos module. Check your IE configuration"
msgstr "Упозорење: примљени токен вероватно је NTLM, који није подржан од стране Kerberos модула. Проверите своју IE конфигурацију"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:604
msgid ""
"Is your Zammad host accessible at an FQDN? This error may indicate that you "
"configured your Zammad host as a numeric IP address instead."
msgstr ""
"Да ли је ваш Zammad хост доступан путем FQDN-a? Ова грешка може указивати на "
"то да сте уместо тога конфигурисали Zammad хост као нумеричку IP адресу."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:605
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cannot decrypt ticket for HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN"
msgstr "Није могуће дешифровати тикет за HTTP/FQDN@DOMAIN"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:609
msgid ""
"Did you make sure to change the password on your Active Directory service "
"account _after enabling 256-bit AES encryption?_"
msgstr ""
"Да ли сте се побринули да промените лозинку на свом корисничком налогу "
"сервиса у Active Directory-u _након омогућавања AES енкрипције од 256 бита?_?"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:612
msgid ""
"And did you make sure to register the SPN (with `ktpass`) and generate your "
"keytab (with `ktutil`) _after changing your password?_"
msgstr ""
"И да ли сте се побринули да региструјете SPN (са `ktpass`) и генеришете свој "
"keytab (са `ktutil`) _након промене лозинке?_?"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:618
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Try running `kinit -k -t <path to keytab> HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>`.\n"
"If no output is returned, you're good - if you see \"kinit:\n"
"Preauthentication failed while getting initial credentials\" your\n"
"credentials provided were wrong or you used `/pass *` during ktpass\n"
"command.\n"
msgstr ""
"Покушајте да покренете `kinit -k -t <putanja do keytaba> HTTP/<zammad-host>@<DOMAIN>`.\n"
"Ако нема излаза, све је у реду - ако видите \"кинит:\n"
"Неуспешна провера аутентификације при дохватању почетних акредитива\" ваши\n"
"унесени подаци су нетачни или сте користили `/pass *` током ктпасс\n"
"команде.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:619
#, no-wrap
msgid "Failed when verifying KDC\" and \"failed to verify krb5 credentials: Decrypt integrity check failed"
msgstr "Није успела провера KDC-а\" и \"није успела провера krb5 акредитива: Није успела провера интегритета дешифровања"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:622
msgid "Ensure `KrbServiceName` is the correct ServiceName provided via setspn."
msgstr ""
"Проверите да ли је `KrbServiceName` тачан ServiceName достављен путем сетспн."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:624
msgid "Ensure your Active Directory supports the encryption method configured."
msgstr ""
"Проверите да ли ваш Active Directory подржава конфигурисану методу "
"енкрипције."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/sso-kerberos.md:627
msgid ""
"If all above is correct and the rest of FAQ also is ensured, make sure your "
"client does not cache the results. `klist purge` clears the clients cache - "
"a reboot of your client would do too."
msgstr ""
"Ако је све горе наведено тачно и сва остала питања у FAQ-u су решена, "
"побрините се да ваш клијент не кешира резултате. `klist purge` брише кеш "
"клијента - рестартовање клијента би такође помогло."

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Webserver configuration"
msgstr "Конфигурација web сервера"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:13
msgid ""
"Configure your webserver to reverse-proxy the Zammad application server.  "
"This guide covers obtaining an SSL certificate, adjusting the sample "
"configuration for Nginx and Apache 2 and reloading the webserver to apply "
"the changes."
msgstr ""
"Подесите свој веб сервер да буде обрнути прокси за Zammad апликативни "
"сервер. Овај водич покрива добављање SSL сертификата, прилагођавање примера "
"подешавања за Nginx и Apache 2 и поновно учитавање веб сервера да би се "
"промене примениле."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:22
msgid ""
"You can find sample configuration files for your webserver within the "
"`contrib/` directory of your Zammad installation. There are two example "
"files per webserver: `zammad.conf` (plain HTTP) and `zammad_ssl.conf` "
"(HTTPS). The non-SSL file is intended for local testing only and must not be "
"used in production. During a package installation of Zammad, the package "
"automatically copies the non-SSL `zammad.conf` to your webserver's config "
"directory. For production use, replace it with `zammad_ssl.conf` and follow "
"the steps on this page."
msgstr ""
"Примере датотека подешавања за свој веб сервер можете наћи у `contrib/` "
"директоријуму своје Zammad инсталације. Постоје две датотеке примера по веб "
"серверу: `zammad.conf` (обичан HTTP) и `zammad_ssl.conf` (HTTPS). Датотека "
"без SSL-а је намењена само локалном тестирању и не сме се користити у "
"производном окружењу. Током инсталације Zammad-а путем пакета, пакет "
"аутоматски копира `zammad.conf` без SSL-а у директоријум подешавања вашег "
"веб сервера. За производну употребу, замените је са `zammad_ssl.conf` и "
"пратите кораке на овој страни."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Docker Compose / Kubernetes users:**\n"
"\n"
"Skip this page. Configure the webserver port, hostname and scheme via the\n"
"`NGINX_*` and `ZAMMAD_RAILSSERVER_*` variables on the\n"
"[environment variables page](/en/reference/environment-variables).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Корисници Docker Compose-а / Kubernetes-а:**\n"
"\n"
"Прескочите ову страну. Подесите порт веб сервера, назив сервера и шему преко\n"
"`NGINX_*` и `ZAMMAD_RAILSSERVER_*` променљивих на\n"
"[страни са променљивама окружења](/en/reference/environment-variables).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtain an SSL certificate"
msgstr "Набавите SSL сертификат"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:35
msgid ""
"Zammad requires HTTPS in production. Use one of the options below to obtain "
"a certificate before continuing with the webserver configuration."
msgstr ""
"Zammad захтева HTTPS у производном окружењу. Употребите једну од опција "
"испод да добавите сертификат пре него што наставите са подешавањем веб "
"сервера."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Commercial certificate authority"
msgstr "Комерцијални орган за издавање сертификата"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:45
msgid ""
"Buy an annual certificate from any trusted public CA. A few common options "
"are [Sectigo](https://sectigo.com/ssl-certificates-tls){target=_blank}, "
"[GlobalSign](https://www.globalsign.com/en/managed-ssl){target=_blank} or "
"[DigiCert](https://www.digicert.com/tls-ssl/){target=_blank}. Install the "
"resulting certificate, key and chain on your server as you would for any "
"HTTPS service, then continue with the webserver configuration below."
msgstr ""
"Купите годишњи сертификат од било ког поузданог јавног CA. Неколико "
"уобичајених опција су [Sectigo](https://sectigo.com/ssl-certificates-tls)"
"{target=_blank}, [GlobalSign](https://www.globalsign.com/en/managed-ssl)"
"{target=_blank} или [DigiCert](https://www.digicert.com/tls-ssl/)"
"{target=_blank}. Инсталирајте добијени сертификат, кључ и ланац на свој "
"сервер као што бисте то урадили за било који HTTPS сервис, а затим наставите "
"са подешавањем веб сервера испод."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let's Encrypt"
msgstr "Let's Encrypt"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:50
msgid ""
"Let's Encrypt issues free, automatically renewable certificates. Two clients "
"are commonly used."
msgstr ""
"Let's Encrypt издаје бесплатне сертификате које је могуће аутоматски "
"обнављати. Обично се користе два клијента."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:51
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Certbot\n"
"\n"
"Certbot is the most widely used ACME client. Follow the upstream\n"
"[Certbot installation instructions](https://certbot.eff.org/instructions){target=_blank},\n"
"select your distribution and the matching webserver plugin in the\n"
"selector and complete the install. Once installed, request a certificate\n"
"by replacing `<webserver>` with `nginx` or `apache` and\n"
"`zammad.example.com` with your subdomain:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo certbot --<webserver> -d zammad.example.com\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Certbot will issue the certificate, ask whether to redirect HTTP to HTTPS\n"
"(choose `[1] not redirect` if you plan to use the Zammad sample\n"
"configuration, which already handles the redirect, otherwise choose\n"
"`[2] redirect`) and arrange automatic renewal once the certificate has\n"
"less than 30 days of validity remaining.\n"
"\n"
"=== acme.sh\n"
"\n"
"[acme.sh](https://github.com/acmesh-official/acme.sh){target=_blank} is\n"
"a lightweight shell-based ACME client and an alternative to Certbot, but\n"
"it no longer uses Let's Encrypt by default. Set the default CA to Let's\n"
"Encrypt before issuing a certificate:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --set-default-ca --server letsencrypt\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Issue the certificate by replacing `<webserver-plugin>` with `nginx`,\n"
"`apache` or `standalone` and `zammad.example.com` with your subdomain:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --issue --<webserver-plugin> -d zammad.example.com\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Install the certificate to a directory of your choice (e.g.\n"
"`/etc/ssl/private/`) and reload the webserver after each renewal.\n"
"Replace `<webserver-service>` in the command below with the matching\n"
"systemd service name (`nginx`, `apache2` or `httpd`):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --install-cert -d zammad.example.com \\\n"
"    --cert-file      /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.pem  \\\n"
"    --key-file       /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.key  \\\n"
"    --fullchain-file /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.full.pem \\\n"
"    --reloadcmd     \"sudo systemctl force-reload <webserver-service>\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"See the\n"
"[acme.sh documentation](https://github.com/acmesh-official/acme.sh/wiki/How-to-issue-a-cert){target=_blank}\n"
"for further use cases.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Certbot\n"
"\n"
"Certbot је најшире коришћен ACME клијент. Пратите изворна\n"
"[упутства за инсталацију Certbot-а](https://certbot.eff.org/instructions){target=_blank},\n"
"изаберите своју дистрибуцију и одговарајући прикључак за веб сервер у\n"
"бирачу и завршите инсталацију. Након инсталације, затражите сертификат\n"
"тако што ћете заменити `<webserver>` са `nginx` или `apache` и\n"
"`zammad.example.com` својим поддоменом:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo certbot --<webserver> -d zammad.example.com\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Certbot ће издати сертификат, питати да ли да преусмери HTTP на HTTPS\n"
"(изаберите `[1] not redirect` ако планирате да користите пример Zammad\n"
"подешавања, које већ обрађује преусмеравање, у супротном изаберите\n"
"`[2] redirect`) и организовати аутоматско обнављање када сертификату\n"
"остане мање од 30 дана важности.\n"
"\n"
"=== acme.sh\n"
"\n"
"[acme.sh](https://github.com/acmesh-official/acme.sh){target=_blank} је\n"
"лаган ACME клијент заснован на љусци и алтернатива Certbot-у, али\n"
"подразумевано више не користи Let's Encrypt. Поставите подразумевани CA на Let's\n"
"Encrypt пре издавања сертификата:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --set-default-ca --server letsencrypt\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Издајте сертификат тако што ћете заменити `<webserver-plugin>` са `nginx`,\n"
"`apache` или `standalone` и `zammad.example.com` својим поддоменом:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --issue --<webserver-plugin> -d zammad.example.com\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Инсталирајте сертификат у директоријум по свом избору (нпр.\n"
"`/etc/ssl/private/`) и поново учитајте веб сервер после сваког обнављања.\n"
"Замените `<webserver-service>` у команди испод одговарајућим\n"
"називом systemd сервиса (`nginx`, `apache2` или `httpd`):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"acme.sh --install-cert -d zammad.example.com \\\n"
"    --cert-file      /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.pem  \\\n"
"    --key-file       /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.key  \\\n"
"    --fullchain-file /etc/ssl/private/zammad.example.com.full.pem \\\n"
"    --reloadcmd     \"sudo systemctl force-reload <webserver-service>\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Погледајте\n"
"[документацију acme.sh](https://github.com/acmesh-official/acme.sh/wiki/How-to-issue-a-cert){target=_blank}\n"
"за додатне случајеве употребе.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the webserver configuration"
msgstr "Прилагођавање конфигурације web сервера"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "<!-- markdownlint-disable MD036 -->\n"
msgstr ",\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:113
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Nginx (default)\n"
"\n"
"**Get the sample config into place**\n"
"\n"
"Copy the SSL sample configuration to your Nginx config directory:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo cp /opt/zammad/contrib/nginx/zammad_ssl.conf \\\n"
"    /etc/nginx/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Most common Nginx config directories:\n"
"\n"
"- `/etc/nginx/conf.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/nginx/vhosts.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/nginx/sites-available/`\n"
"\n"
"**Adjust server name and certificate paths**\n"
"\n"
"Adjust the just copied file with a text editor of your choice (e.g.\n"
"vi or nano). Locate both `server_name` directives (one in the HTTP\n"
"server block on port 80, one in the HTTPS server block on port 443)\n"
"and adjust `example.com` to the subdomain you have chosen for your\n"
"Zammad instance.\n"
"\n"
"Now you'll need to adjust the path and file names for your SSL\n"
"certificates you obtained on the prior steps. Adjust the following\n"
"directives to match your setup:\n"
"\n"
"- `ssl_certificate` (your SSL certificate)\n"
"- `ssl_certificate_key` (the certificate's private key)\n"
"- `ssl_trusted_certificate` (the public CA certificate)\n"
"\n"
"To improve HTTPS security, also configure a Diffie-Hellman parameter\n"
"file and point `ssl_dhparam` at it:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo openssl dhparam -out /etc/ssl/dhparam.pem 4096\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**Reload and verify**\n"
"\n"
"Verify the configuration:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo nginx -t\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Reload Nginx:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl reload nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Apache 2\n"
"\n"
"**Enable the required modules**\n"
"\n"
"Zammad requires modules that are not enabled by default. On Ubuntu,\n"
"Debian and openSUSE use `a2enmod`:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo a2enmod proxy proxy_html proxy_http proxy_wstunnel headers ssl\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"For HTTP/2 support also enable:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo a2enmod h2 proxy_http2 mpm_event\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"On CentOS / RHEL add the matching `LoadModule` lines to\n"
"`/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf` instead:\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"LoadModule headers_module modules/mod_headers.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_module modules/mod_proxy.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_html_module modules/mod_proxy_html.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_http_module modules/mod_proxy_http.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_wstunnel_module modules/mod_proxy_wstunnel.so\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Restart Apache after enabling the modules:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**Get the sample config into place**\n"
"\n"
"Copy the SSL sample configuration to your Apache config directory:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo cp /opt/zammad/contrib/apache2/zammad_ssl.conf \\\n"
"    /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Most common Apache config directories:\n"
"\n"
"- `/etc/apache2/conf.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/httpd/vhosts.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/apache2/sites-available/`\n"
"\n"
"The package installation attempts to copy this file for you. Do not\n"
"rename it.\n"
"\n"
"**Adjust server name and certificate paths**\n"
"\n"
"Adjust the just copied file with a text editor of your choice (e.g.\n"
"vi or nano). Locate any `ServerName` directive and adjust `example.com`\n"
"to the subdomain you have chosen for your Zammad instance. The first\n"
"`ServerName` (in the HTTP VirtualHost) defaults to `example.com` and\n"
"the second (in the HTTPS VirtualHost) to `localhost`.\n"
"\n"
"Now you'll need to adjust the path and file names for your SSL\n"
"certificates you obtained on the prior steps. Adjust the following\n"
"directives to match your setup:\n"
"\n"
"- `SSLCertificateFile` (your SSL certificate)\n"
"- `SSLCertificateKeyFile` (the certificate's private key)\n"
"- `SSLCertificateChainFile` (the public CA certificate)\n"
"\n"
"To improve HTTPS security, also configure a Diffie-Hellman parameter\n"
"file and point `SSLOpenSSLConfCmd DHParameters` at it:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo openssl dhparam -out /etc/ssl/dhparam.pem 4096\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**Enable the site**\n"
"\n"
"On Ubuntu, Debian and openSUSE:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo a2ensite zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"On CentOS / RHEL:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo ln -s /etc/httpd/sites-available/zammad_ssl.conf /etc/httpd/sites-enabled/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Make sure `IncludeOptional sites-enabled/*.conf` is present in\n"
"`/etc/apache2/apache2.conf` (Ubuntu, Debian, openSUSE) or\n"
"`/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf` (CentOS / RHEL).\n"
"\n"
"**Reload and verify**\n"
"\n"
"Reload Apache and verify the configuration:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl reload apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Local testing or other proxy servers\n"
"\n"
"Zammad's main application listens on port `3000` and the WebSocket\n"
"server on port `6042`. If you put your own reverse proxy in front of\n"
"Zammad, forward both.\n"
"\n"
"If the default ports conflict with other applications on your host, see\n"
"the [environment variables page](/en/reference/environment-variables) to\n"
"change them.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Nginx (default)\n"
"\n"
"**Постављање примера подешавања**\n"
"\n"
"Копирајте пример SSL подешавања у директоријум подешавања вашег Nginx-а:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo cp /opt/zammad/contrib/nginx/zammad_ssl.conf \\\n"
"    /etc/nginx/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Најчешћи Nginx директоријуми подешавања:\n"
"\n"
"- `/etc/nginx/conf.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/nginx/vhosts.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/nginx/sites-available/`\n"
"\n"
"**Прилагодите назив сервера и путање сертификата**\n"
"\n"
"Прилагодите управо копирану датотеку текстуалним уређивачем по свом избору (нпр.\n"
"vi или nano). Пронађите обе `server_name` директиве (једну у HTTP\n"
"блоку сервера на порту 80, једну у HTTPS блоку сервера на порту 443)\n"
"и прилагодите `example.com` поддомену који сте изабрали за своју\n"
"Zammad инстанцу.\n"
"\n"
"Сада ћете морати да прилагодите путању и називе датотека својих SSL\n"
"сертификата које сте добили у претходним корацима. Прилагодите следеће\n"
"директиве својој поставци:\n"
"\n"
"- `ssl_certificate` (ваш SSL сертификат)\n"
"- `ssl_certificate_key` (тајни кључ сертификата)\n"
"- `ssl_trusted_certificate` (јавни CA сертификат)\n"
"\n"
"Да бисте побољшали HTTPS безбедност, подесите и датотеку Diffie-Hellman\n"
"параметара и усмерите `ssl_dhparam` на њу:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo openssl dhparam -out /etc/ssl/dhparam.pem 4096\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**Поновно учитавање и провера**\n"
"\n"
"Проверите подешавање:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo nginx -t\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Поново учитајте Nginx:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl reload nginx\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Apache 2\n"
"\n"
"**Укључите неопходне модуле**\n"
"\n"
"Zammad захтева модуле који нису подразумевано укључени. На Ubuntu-у,\n"
"Debian-у и openSUSE-у користите `a2enmod`:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo a2enmod proxy proxy_html proxy_http proxy_wstunnel headers ssl\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"За подршку за HTTP/2 укључите и:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo a2enmod h2 proxy_http2 mpm_event\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"На CentOS-у / RHEL-у уместо тога додајте одговарајуће `LoadModule` линије у\n"
"`/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf`:\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"LoadModule headers_module modules/mod_headers.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_module modules/mod_proxy.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_html_module modules/mod_proxy_html.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_http_module modules/mod_proxy_http.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_wstunnel_module modules/mod_proxy_wstunnel.so\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Поново покрените Apache након укључивања модула:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl restart apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**Постављање примера подешавања**\n"
"\n"
"Копирајте пример SSL подешавања у директоријум подешавања вашег Apache-а:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo cp /opt/zammad/contrib/apache2/zammad_ssl.conf \\\n"
"    /etc/apache2/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Најчешћи Apache директоријуми подешавања:\n"
"\n"
"- `/etc/apache2/conf.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/httpd/vhosts.d/`\n"
"- `/etc/apache2/sites-available/`\n"
"\n"
"Инсталација путем пакета покушава да копира ову датотеку за вас. Не\n"
"преименујте је.\n"
"\n"
"**Прилагодите назив сервера и путање сертификата**\n"
"\n"
"Прилагодите управо копирану датотеку текстуалним уређивачем по свом избору (нпр.\n"
"vi или nano). Пронађите било коју `ServerName` директиву и прилагодите `example.com`\n"
"поддомену који сте изабрали за своју Zammad инстанцу. Прва\n"
"`ServerName` (у HTTP VirtualHost-у) подразумевано је `example.com`, а\n"
"друга (у HTTPS VirtualHost-у) `localhost`.\n"
"\n"
"Сада ћете морати да прилагодите путању и називе датотека својих SSL\n"
"сертификата које сте добили у претходним корацима. Прилагодите следеће\n"
"директиве својој поставци:\n"
"\n"
"- `SSLCertificateFile` (ваш SSL сертификат)\n"
"- `SSLCertificateKeyFile` (тајни кључ сертификата)\n"
"- `SSLCertificateChainFile` (јавни CA сертификат)\n"
"\n"
"Да бисте побољшали HTTPS безбедност, подесите и датотеку Diffie-Hellman\n"
"параметара и усмерите `SSLOpenSSLConfCmd DHParameters` на њу:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo openssl dhparam -out /etc/ssl/dhparam.pem 4096\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"**Укључите сајт**\n"
"\n"
"На Ubuntu-у, Debian-у и openSUSE-у:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo a2ensite zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"На CentOS-у / RHEL-у:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo ln -s /etc/httpd/sites-available/zammad_ssl.conf /etc/httpd/sites-enabled/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Проверите да ли је `IncludeOptional sites-enabled/*.conf` присутно у\n"
"`/etc/apache2/apache2.conf` (Ubuntu, Debian, openSUSE) или\n"
"`/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf` (CentOS / RHEL).\n"
"\n"
"**Поновно учитавање и провера**\n"
"\n"
"Поново учитајте Apache и проверите подешавање:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo systemctl reload apache2\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Локално тестирање или други прокси сервери\n"
"\n"
"Zammad-ова главна апликација слуша на порту `3000`, а WebSocket\n"
"сервер на порту `6042`. Ако постављате сопствени обрнути прокси испред\n"
"Zammad-а, преусмерите оба.\n"
"\n"
"Ако су подразумевани портови у конфликту са другим апликацијама на вашем серверу, погледајте\n"
"[страну са променљивама окружења](/en/reference/environment-variables) да\n"
"их промените.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|warning)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:113
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Do not expose Zammad directly to the internet. Zammad only provides\n"
"plain HTTP and would be reachable without authentication.\n"
msgstr ""
"Не излажите Zammad директно интернету. Zammad пружа само\n"
"обичан HTTP и био би доступан без аутентификације.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:288
#, no-wrap
msgid "<!-- markdownlint-enable MD036 -->\n"
msgstr ",\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:292
msgid ""
"Now visit your configured Zammad domain in a browser to reach the Zammad UI. "
"If you don't see Zammad's setup wizard or Zammad UI at all, check the "
"[Troubleshooting section](#troubleshooting) below."
msgstr ""
"Сада посетите свој подешени Zammad домен у прегледачу да бисте дошли до "
"Zammad интерфејса. Ако уопште не видите Zammad-овог чаробњака за подешавање "
"или Zammad интерфејс, погледајте [одељак Решавање проблема]"
"(#troubleshooting) испод."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:295
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default landing page instead of Zammad"
msgstr "Подразумевана почетна страна уместо Zammad-а"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:301
msgid ""
"If you reach the webserver's default landing page rather than Zammad, your "
"`zammad.conf` may be overruled by another config file. Check the vhost "
"directory for `000-default.conf` or `default.conf` and disable it."
msgstr ""
"Ако дођете до подразумеване почетне стране веб сервера уместо до Zammad-а, "
"вашу `zammad.conf` можда преиначује друга датотека подешавања. Проверите "
"vhost директоријум за `000-default.conf` или `default.conf` и искључите је."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:302
#, no-wrap
msgid "DNS not resolving"
msgstr "DNS се не разрешава"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:308
msgid ""
"If the subdomain does not resolve, double-check the DNS records for your "
"domain and wait for them to propagate. Replace the `zammad.example.com` in "
"the following command with your configured domain of Zammad and check if the "
"domain points to the right server:"
msgstr ""
"Ако се поддомен не разрешава, још једном проверите DNS записе за свој домен "
"и сачекајте да се прошире. Замените `zammad.example.com` у следећој команди "
"својим подешеним Zammad доменом и проверите да ли домен упућује на прави "
"сервер:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:309
#, no-wrap
msgid "host zammad.example.com\n"
msgstr "host zammad.example.com\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:313
#, no-wrap
msgid "CSRF token errors"
msgstr "Грешке CSRF токена"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:318
msgid ""
"If users cannot log in because of CSRF token errors, your webserver chain "
"may not pass the original connection type to Zammad. Tell the proxy directly "
"that the connection is HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"Ако корисници не могу да се пријаве због грешака CSRF токена, ваш ланац веб "
"сервера можда не прослеђује Zammad-у оригиналну врсту конекције. Реците "
"проксију директно да је конекција HTTPS."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:323
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Nginx\n"
": Within your virtual host configuration, locate\n"
"  `proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto` and replace `$scheme` with\n"
"  `https`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nginx\n"
": У подешавању свог виртуелног хоста пронађите\n"
"  `proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto` и замените `$scheme` са\n"
"  `https`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:327
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Apache 2\n"
": Within your virtual host configuration, just above the first\n"
"  `ProxyPass` directive, insert:\n"
msgstr ""
"Apache 2\n"
": У подешавању свог виртуелног хоста, непосредно пре прве\n"
"  `ProxyPass` директиве, убаците:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (apache)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:328
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  RequestHeader set X_FORWARDED_PROTO 'https'\n"
"  RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-Ssl on\n"
msgstr ""
"  RequestHeader set X_FORWARDED_PROTO 'https'\n"
"  RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-Ssl on\n"

